===Verb===
{{pt-verb}}

# {{lb|pt|ditransitive}} to [[give]]
## {{+obj|pt|&transitive + :a/:para/indirobj&pronoun}}
### to transfer one’s possession of something to someone without anything in return
###: {{ux|pt| '''Dar'''-te-'''ei''' um livro.|t=I '''will give''' you a book.}}
###: {{syn|pt|ceder}}
###: {{ant|pt|receber}}
### to [[hand over]] {{gl|to pass something into someone’s hand}}
###: {{ux|pt|'''Dá'''-me tua mão.|t='''Give''' me your hand.}}
###: {{syn|pt|entregar|passar}}
### to make a present or gift of
###: {{ux|pt|'''Dei''' flores à minha mulher.|t='''I gave''' my wife flowers.}}
###: {{syn|pt|presentear}}
###: {{ant|pt|ganhar|receber}}
### to provide a service
###: {{ux|pt|A Igreja '''dá''' conforto aos pobres.|t=The Church '''gives''' the poor comfort.}}
###: {{ux|pt|Ele '''dá''' aulas de latim.|t=He '''gives''' Latin classes.}}
###: {{syn|pt|oferecer}}
### to [[administer]] {{gl|to cause to take (medicine)}}
###: {{ux|pt|'''Demos''' insulina a ele.|t='''We gave''' him insulin.}}
###: {{syn|pt|administrar}}
### {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[give]]; to [[issue]]; to [[emit]]
###: {{ux|pt|O João vai nos '''dar''' recomendações.|t=João will '''give''' us recommendations.}}
###: {{ux|pt|Ele gosta de '''dar''' ordens.|t=He likes '''issuing''' orders.}}
## {{+obj|pt|&transitive + :em/indirobj&pronoun}}
### to carry out a physical interaction with something
###: {{ux|pt|Ela '''deu'''-me um beijo.|t=She '''gave''' me a kiss.}}
### to cause a sensation or feeling
###: {{ux|pt|A cerca me '''deu''' um choque elétrico.|t=The fence '''gave''' me an electric shock.}}
###: {{ux|pt|Essa música '''dá'''-me medo.|t=That song frightens me.|lit=That song '''gives''' me fear.}}
### to [[cause]] {{gl|to produce as a result}}
###: {{ux|pt|Comer rápido lhe '''dá''' azia.|t=Eating quickly '''gives''' you a heartburn.}}
# to [[yield]]; to [[produce]]; to [[generate]]
#: {{ux|pt|Esse poço '''dava''' água.|t=That well '''used to produce''' water.}}
#: {{ux|pt|As macieiras '''dão''' maçãs.|t=Apple trees '''produce''' apples.}}
# {{lb|pt|impersonal}} to be [[possible]], [[can]] {{+obj|pt|:para(subject&pronoun<qq:optional> + pers&inf)<for someone to do something>}}
#: {{ux|pt|Não '''dá''' para ele fazer isso.|He '''can't''' do that.}}
#: {{ux|pt|– '''Dá''' para o alcançarmos?<br>– '''Dá'''.|– '''Can''' we reach him?<br>– Yes, we '''can'''.}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[throw]] {{gl|to organise an event}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Darei''' uma festa amanhã.|t='''I’ll throw''' a party tomorrow.}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[report]] {{gl|to [[publish]] or [[broadcast]] news}} {{+obj|pt|:que(clause)<that ...>}}
#: {{ux|pt|O jornal '''deu''' que se cancelaram os eventos.|t=The newspaper '''reported''' that the events had been cancelled.}}
# {{lb|pt|impersonal}} to be [[report]]ed {{gl|to be published or broadcasted, of news}} {{+obj|pt|:em<a source> + :que(clause)<that ...>}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Deu''' no jornal que se cancelaram os eventos.|t=The newspaper '''reported''' that the events had been cancelled.|lit='''It was reported''' in the newspaper that ...}}
# {{lb|pt|intransitive|or|transitive}} to [[result]] in, to [[lead]] to {{+obj|pt|:em/transitive<a result>}}
#: {{ux|pt|Não te preocupes, não '''dará''' em nada.|t=Don’t worry, it won’t '''lead to''' anything.}}
# {{lb|pt|impersonal|intransitive|or|auxiliary}} to [[suffice]], to be [[enough]] {{+obj|pt|:para<for something>|:para(subject&pronoun<qq:optional> + pers&inf)<for doing something>}}
#: {{ux|pt|Com dez euros já '''dá''' para almoçar hoje.|t=Ten euros '''are enough''' to have lunch today.|lit=With ten euros '''it''' already '''suffices''' to have lunch today.}}
#: {{syn|pt|bastar}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[make]] {{gl|to tend or be able to become}}
#: {{ux|pt|Ela '''daria''' uma boa professora.|t=She would '''make''' a good teacher.}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[consider]] {{gl|assign some quality}} {{+obj|pt|dirobj<someone/something> + :por/:como<as something>}}
#: {{ux|pt|Depois de semanas procurando, '''deram'''-nos como desaparecidos.|t=After weeks of searching, '''they considered''' us to be missing.}}
#: {{syn|pt|considerar}}
# {{lb|pt|<<transitive>> (<<Portugal>>) or <<intransitive>> (<<Brazil>>)|colloquial}} to [[defeat]] by a given score {{+obj|pt|dirobj<ll:Portugal>/:de<ll:Brazil><a score> + :a<ll:Portugal>/:em<ll:Brazil><someone or someone's team>}}
